  "name": "Cucumber Sandwich",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, creamy no-cook lunch sandwich",
  "description": "Softened cream cheese, fresh vegetables, sprouts, and mashed avocado layered between whole wheat bread make a quick vegetarian sandwich.",
